  "note": "W1-01 PROVINCE viewpoint set, APPENDED per HARNESS.md \u00a76 (\"viewpoints may be added by amendment\"). It does not touch tools/harness/viewpoints.json: the twelve canonical poses are absolute and sit within 130 m of the world origin, the world origin is 250 m out in the Topal Bay, and changing a pose invalidates every cross-wave comparison that used it. Those twelve keep shooting W1-00's origin neighbourhood (the `showcase` cell, reached by the state `showcase_patch` and by every anchor state that sets `env.showcase`); these shoot the province. Capture with tools/world/province-shots.mjs, which teleports, streams the tiles in, and poses the camera directly.",
